WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.671
Step one. What Autopay is.

2
00:00:02.671 --> 00:00:10.248
Welcome to Quasaria Autopay. Your down payment goes into an on-chain vault, where it earns simulated yield.

3
00:00:10.248 --> 00:00:17.271
Every demo month, which is just five minutes here, the vault sends that yield to your lender as extra principal.

4
00:00:17.271 --> 00:00:24.778
You still make every payment. The loan simply ends sooner. You can watch the live demo deal without a wallet.

5
00:00:24.778 --> 00:00:33.017
This is testnet only, with test tokens and simulated yield. All figures are illustrative, and nothing is guaranteed.

